+## Routes
+
+The full list is in `README.md`. Notes on routes that need more than a line:
+
+- `POST /import/sales` takes `{ "csv": "..." }` with the columns
+  `ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty` (`soldAt` is an ISO instant, `qty` a whole
+  number). Each dish sold uses one portion of its recipe per `qty`, consumed
+  with the ledger `ref` `sale:<ticket>` at `soldAt`. Tickets imported before
+  are skipped. Answers `{ "tickets": n, "dishes": n }` (dishes is the total
+  `qty` imported). If any row is invalid (`bad_request`) or an item runs out
+  (`sale_not_enough_stock`), nothing is imported and the message names the
+  row (`row 2` is the first data row).
+- `GET /reports/variance?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD` lists
+  `{ itemId, theoretical, actual, difference }` per item for those days
+  (inclusive): theoretical use from sales sold on those days, actual use
+  from every `consume` movement, and `difference = actual - theoretical`.
+  Items where both are zero are left out.
