+## Sales
+
+- `sales` holds imported till tickets: `{ id, ticket, soldAt, lines:
+  [{ dishId, qty }], uses: [{ itemId, qty }] }`. `uses` is what the ticket
+  took from stock when imported (one recipe portion per dish sold), so later
+  recipe changes do not rewrite past variance. A ticket is imported once.
+- The collection is optional (missing means no sales), so files without it
+  open without a schema change.
